@startuml
title OC-D05 Ticket Lookup and Statutory Discount Validation Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

actor Operator
participant "Operator Console UI" as UI
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Discount Workflow" as Discount
participant "Evidence Service /\nEvidence Repository" as Evidence
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Operator -> UI : Scan or manually enter ticket reference
UI -> Central : Site-scoped session lookup
Central --> UI : Session context or lookup outcome
UI -> Audit : Record lookup attempt and result

alt session found and active
  UI --> Operator : Display read-only session context
  Operator -> UI : Start Senior Citizen / PWD validation
  UI --> Operator : Show privacy notice
  Operator -> UI : Provide structured metadata and evidence
  UI -> Evidence : Capture evidence reference / hash / metadata
  Evidence --> UI : Evidence reference
  UI -> Discount : Submit validation request\nwith session context and evidence reference
  Discount -> Central : Validate policy and payable-basis effect\nthrough backend authority
  Central --> Discount : Validation outcome
  Discount --> UI : approved / rejected / pending / duplicate / failed
  UI -> Audit : Record validation action, outcome, and evidence reference
  UI --> Operator : Display outcome and allowed next steps
else not found / inactive / ambiguous / unavailable
  UI --> Operator : Display fail-closed lookup message
  UI -> Audit : Record failed or blocked lookup
end

note bottom
The console does not recalculate tariff
and does not mutate payable basis directly.
end note

@enduml
